  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We Are! Climate Justice Campaign in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build a pan-African creative and cultural voice on climate change in the run-up to COP27, raising the profile and salience of key issues of resonance to African publics, including situating community experiences of adaptation and locally grounded visions for a low-carbon, climate-resilient future.

To engage local communities in climate action in an accessible and understandable manner through bottom-up campaigns.

To build public opinion and awareness of African-led, low-carbon climate solutions and development pathways that can create thriving and resilient communities in the lead up to COP27</narrative>
  </description>
