  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Activations (Community showcase)

Hosting a creative activation that is community led with selected stakeholders as participants. Vulnerable communities are identified through a clear climate impact metric. The framework takes into account key climate vulnerability measures (energy poverty, water access/shortage, ecological damage, droughts, livestock sustainability etc). These metrics are contextualised to the context. We activate these communities by using creative tools and collaboration to amplify their solutions for adaptation and tell their story. This activation is led by community artists.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275814" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-host at least 1x community showcase in a vulnerable community in Nigeria, with key policy-makers, activists, communities, and creatives to cultivate champions for African-led, low-carbon development in the lead up to COP27.</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="1"></target>
     <actual value="2"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
