  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership engagement in Nigeria (one out of 6 African countries)

In partnership with climate activists and creatives, we will host and broadcast at least 1 public creative showcase and/or activation in a climate-vulnerable community in Nigeria to facilitate public engagement and community participation. Exploring unconventional methods and spaces to amplify African climate action and creativity through interactive; experiential pop-up showcases and High-level events.</narrative>
   </title>
