  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative Campaigning Workshop

Through a hybrid of online and in-person workshops, transforming creatives into
&#x201c;Creative Campaigners&#x201d; (CC&#x2019;s). They will be capacitated with the skills and
knowledge needed to socialise the just transition and the green economy into creative, cutting edge, pan-African campaigns that bridge the gap between communities and policymakers, through their creative medium.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275812" vocabulary="99"></reference>
